    "body": "> @mikewest it seems you didn't update all call sites of the algorithms. These are also used by workers. Presumably those need to pass the empty string?\n\nThat's \"[fetch a classic worker script](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#fetch-a-classic-worker-script)\", right? I didn't update that algorithm, as we're not currently doing anything nonce-related for Workers. If/when we do, I'd certainly throw a patch your way.\n",
